      <section id="about" class="about-area">
                  <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
               <h1 class="section-name" style="color: #2c5f2d">About Runwal Malabar Hill Project</h1>
               <div class="col-lg-7">
                  <div id="abt-text" class="abt-txt-area">
                     <p><strong>Runwal Malabar Hill</strong> is a Project by <strong>Runwal Realty</strong> situated in the most premium location of <strong>Mumbai</strong>, Malabar Hill, NEXT TO THE GOVERNOR’S ESTATE offers&nbsp;<strong> Duplex</strong> Apartment . Also get Floor Plan, Price Sheet, RERA ID, Reviews, Possession Timeline, Construction Status, Location Advantages, Address, Amenities &amp; Specifications. Runwal Realty Runwal Malabar Mumbai is an Exclusive Premium Tower of <strong>G + 34</strong> <strong>Storey</strong>. Runwal Malabar Hill Runwal Realty Mumbai Property Features <strong>Amenities</strong> like&nbsp;Serene Infinity Pool, Sunlit Sundeck, Tranquil Jacuzzi, Ice Lounge, Gymnasium, Private Business Suite, Grand Arrival Lobby, Private Drop‑Off And Three‑Sided, Verdant Landscape, The Jacuzzi. Runwal Malabar Hill&nbsp; Has <strong>Excellent Connectivity</strong> Wilson College - 4 Mins, DSB International School - 9 Mins, Hill Spring International School - 10 Mins, Jai Hind College - 12 Mins, The Malabar Hill Club - 4 Mins, Breach Candy Club - 8 Mins, The Taj Mahal Palace - 12 Mins, St. Regis - 14 Mins, Wankhede Stadium - 8 Mins, Mahalaxmi Race Course - 10 Mins, Atria Mall - 12 Mins, Walkeshwar Jain Temple - 2 Mins, Babulnath Temple - 4 Mins, ITC - 16 Mins.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Malabar Hill is well-connected to Worli, Nariman Point, Colaba, Bandra, Churchgate.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Runwal Realty</strong> has many ongoing, upcoming &amp; completed Projects Runwal Anthurium - Mulund, Runwal Mycity - Dombivli East, The Residence -&nbsp; Nepean Sea Road, Runwal Elegante - Andheri West, The Reserve - Worli, Nirvana By - Parel.</p>                  </div>
                
               </div>
